{
  "title": "三种凭证各打一次：401 / 200 / 401",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "u=user1:demo-pass-123"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "url=http://127.0.0.1/"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -so /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" $url"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "401"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -so /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" -u $u $url"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "200"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -so /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\\n\" -u user1:x $url"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "401"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "无凭证与错密码同为 401，正确凭证放行"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx/1.31.5（nginx:alpine 容器）"}
  ]
}
